WEBVTT

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.990
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.990
<b>Dazai and Chuuya, 
Pretentious Fourteen-Year-Olds</b>

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:23.370
<b>Dazai Osamu</b>

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:23.370
<b>Second-year 
middle schooler</b>

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.890
Look at you, with all your adornments.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.380
Do you think you look cool?

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.490
And, what, do you think you look 
cool being wrapped in bandages?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.500
<b>Nakahara Chuuya</b>

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.500
<b>Second-year
 middle schooler</b>

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.250
<b>Menacing</b>

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.700
<i>He's pretty badass.</i>

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:36.620
Do you really need that eyepatch? 
Are you that desperate for attention?

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.360
Oh, I have a sty.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.020
I rubbed my eye with dirty hands.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.220
That's nasty! Wash your hands!

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:50.140
S-So, what, is that bandage around your 
whole body from a huge injury, too?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.880
No, this is to keep my powers at bay.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.640
Oh, so that is something you do.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.930
<i>Jeez, you made me worry.</i>

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.160
I am the reincarnation of 
a mage from ancient times.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.600
I have a pact with the elementals of 
fire, wind, water, light, and darkness,

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:07.550
allowing me to control all 
the elements by my will.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:09.080
Really? Wow.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.420
<i>Actually, it is kind of worrying.</i>

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:16.920
And this is a conduit through which I can 
channel the infinite power of the ether.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:21.940
And this talisman seals away the 
demon that slumbers within me.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:24.290
This is bad!

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.330
The demon is awakening!

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:27.870
That's way too much stuff.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.240
Says you, Chuuya.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:32.700
You're pretty showy for no reason.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.950
Are you compensating for your size?

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:37.860
Shut your mouth!

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.320
Well, whatever.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.070
Let me show you.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:46.090
Custom-made gear, each twenty kilograms, 
weighing in at 80 kilograms total!

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:47.070
And there's more.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.640
If I take off my shoes, 
each weighing 50 kilograms,

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.590
I can move four times faster than normal!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:54.960
I look like four people to you, don't I?

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:56.580
Bring it, Dazai.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.130
I feel so light!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:59.630
Really? Good for you.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.380
Hey!

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:02.590
Don't you think I'm cool?!

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:03.630
Isn't it every boy's dream?!

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.740
That's a bit too stuffy for me.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:08.260
I'd rather read books.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:09.680
One of <i>those</i> books?!

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.690
<b>The Poetry 
of Goethe</b>

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.690
<b>On Love
 and Freedom</b>

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:14.130
I spend so much time studying lately, 
my brain's more active than ever.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.640
It's the perfect time to read 
sophisticated, unintelligible books.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.710
You just admitted that you 
don't understand them.

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.200
Here, you can have this.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.450
<b>Morbid Notes 
on Poetry</b>

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.460
<i>Oh, jeez, this is rough.</i>

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:27.040
<i>I never knew Dazai did
 this kind of thing, too.</i>

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.460
Let's see...

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.660
<i>"Yet again, Chuuya wouldn't 
get out of my sight today."</i>

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.220
<i>"I wish he would get out of my sight."</i>

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:38.340
<i>"Needless to say, I don't want 
to have to look away first."</i>

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:39.850
What is this?

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:42.220
A notebook of my grievances with you.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.210
That's so morbid.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:45.990
I also have 26 more volumes at home.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:48.110
You could just say it to my face!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:52.040
<i>"Chuuya put lemon on the karaage 
without asking. My life sucks."</i>

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.100
So petty!

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:57.110
<i>"Chuuya cranks the echo up too 
high at karaoke. Kill me."</i>

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.390
Why do you care?!

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:02.010
You'll regret this when I get big!

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:05.160
Huh? Isn't that just a hypothetical 
on an impossible situation?

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.320
That's enough, you two.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.150
You two really are the best 
of friends, aren't you?

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:10.790
No, we aren't!

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.580
Mori-sensei...

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.710
<b>Mori Ougai</b>

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.710
<b>Custodian</b>

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.210
Randou-sensei...

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.710
<b>Randou</b>

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.710
<b>Home Instructor</b>

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.940
Are you cold, Randou-sensei?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:22.200
Their style of exchange,
 so typical of middle schoolers...

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.490
It's so embarrassing to watch.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.880
The chills they give me...

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.540
You've been watching this whole time?!

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.650
That's so shady!

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.720
Relax, Chuuya-kun.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.570
If you want to grow taller,

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:37.370
I'll remove your Achilles' 
tendon and stretch you out.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.040
<i>What is this doctor talking about?</i>

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.200
You, too, Dazai-kun.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.170
I'll give you these earmuffs.

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.170
No, thank you.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.610
Thank goodness.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:49.160
Without them, my ears get so cold
they feel like they're going to fall off.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.780
Why did you offer to give them to me?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.100
The school bell already 
rang a long while ago.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.270
You'd best go to class.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.440
You're having pudding for lunch today.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.260
Now, go.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:06.000
Mori-sensei, do you really
 believe those two

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.380
will be able to maintain 
their peace until lunchtime?

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.880
Maybe I'm not suited to being a teacher.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.310
<b>Wan!</b>

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.310
<b>Shorts</b>

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.310
I've been waiting all day for this pudding.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.750
Let's go to the rooftop to 
enjoy it in the breeze.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.740
Dude! Watch where you're going!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.190
You're the one who crashed into me!

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:28.850
This is your fault! Not mine!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.270
Perhaps if you argued with such vigor,

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.710
I was going to eat on the rooftop!

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:34.290
your body heat might rise, 
curing you of your chills.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:34.320
That was my plan! Stop copying me!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:38.040
I appreciate your advice, 
but I will have to decline.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>Episode 13</b>

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.590
<b>A Day in
 Yokohama</b>

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:48.070
Jeez, this wine is so expensive.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:51.840
I can't understand why anyone would 
spend so much money on liquor.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.910
I like some good booze,

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:58.580
but the best drink is the one 
you drink with a charming lady.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:01.830
Well, today's a good day for shopping.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:03.630
Where should I go?

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.980
A bargain discount on bandages?

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.770
How stupid.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.610
Why would you even need bandages if you 
don't get hurt in the first place?

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:15.260
You have to be a wimp to 
want to buy this stuff.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.380
Pathetic.

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.860
This isn't what I want.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.590
<b>Stare...</b>

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.730
What an absurd design for a hat.

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.150
Who would buy these?

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:30.320
I don't think I could hold in my laughter

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.880
if someone walked in front 
of me wearing one of these.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:35.220
I'll have to hope I never see such a person.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.770
<b>Ten newborn 
retrievers</b>

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.770
<b>Looking
 for homes</b>

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:43.580
"Ten newborn retrievers

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.520
looking for homes."

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.560
Adopting puppies, huh?

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:51.660
If only I had the means, 
I'd take nine of them.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.120
Dunno about that last one.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:02.350
"Ten newborn retrievers

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.800
looking for homes."

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:10.800
I wouldn't want to take care of 
a dog, even if I were paid to.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:13.310
That one looked cute, though.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:16.560
Look!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.390
I need those!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.790
They're so cheap!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.450
I'll buy them all! Yup!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:26.580
Man, I'd look down on anyone who walked 
past these things without buying them.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.900
Th-These hats!

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.170
Man!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.180
I've never seen such awesome designs.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:34.820
I'm sold!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:37.840
I can just imagine all the praise.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.260
What's that over there?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.330
I've always wanted to try this wine!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.870
I never thought I'd run into it here!

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.050
This is a rarity.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.080
I'll have to buy this!

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:50.980
That was a good shopping trip.

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.960
I haven't had such a 
fulfilling day in a while.

00:06:57.010 --> 00:07:00.420
<i>Look at all that tacky junk he bought.</i>

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.480
Whatever.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:05.130
You'd get jealous if I told 
you what I bought today.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.670
I'll let you off the hook.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.110
That's my line.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.780
You'd cry if you saw what I got.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.930
Check it out. First...

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:12.590
Not interested.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.230
I ought to kill you.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.810
Stop following me.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.240
Shut up. You're the one following me.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:20.830
Hey, damn it!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.750
You saw, didn't you? Say something!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:33.140
Only a diamond 
can polish
 a diamond.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:26.440
Only a diamond can polish a diamond.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.620
Only a hand can wash a hand.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:33.140
Only a hand 
can wash
 a hand.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.760
If you want to know what a dog feels,
 you'll have to become a dog.

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:33.140
If you want to know
 what a dog feels,
 you'll have to
 become a dog.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.260
<b>Episode 14</b>

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.260
<b><i>The Boy and
 the Puppy</i></b>

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.770
<b>Musical</b>

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.770
The Boy 
and the Puppy

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:42.680
The Boy and the Puppy was such a good play.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.550
<i>The boy, on a rainy day, 
met an abandoned puppy.</i>

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:51.430
<i>The two grow up together.</i>

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:55.290
<i>The puppy's so adorable, helping the boy...</i>

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.750
<i>It was just so good.</i>

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.450
<i>If I were to come across 
an abandoned puppy...</i>

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.460
Woof.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.280
<i>A bark!</i>

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.530
<i>Could it have come true?!</i>

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.820
Woof.

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:10.780
Oh, it's just Chuuya.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.800
<b>Rattle
 rattle</b>

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.440
I saw nothing.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.620
I saw nothing at all.

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.260
Good grief.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.490
I can't believe I'd get trapped like that.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.990
That's animal abuse, Chuuya.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.430
What I saw was something a lot 
more grotesque than an animal.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.060
What the hell is your problem?

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.570
Atsushi-kun asked me 
before if I don't like dogs.

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:46.280
It's true that they are my arch enemy.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:49.250
So, in order to try to get inside the 
mind of a dog, I tried becoming one.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.580
Turns out it fits me 
way better than I'd expected.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.020
You seemed pretty comfortable, for sure.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:57.290
I suppose I am best suited 
to being a stray dog.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.150
<i>I want to rip that nose off you.</i>

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.890
<b>Musical</b>

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.890
<b>The Boy 
and the Puppy</b>

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.810
I guess you've been interested 
in dogs, too, huh?

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.320
You want to adopt a dog?

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:07.480
Even though you're already 
kind of like a dog?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.890
What is that supposed to mean?!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:13.310
You want an obedient dog that'll 
do as its master says, huh?

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:14.540
I get it! Jeez!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.510
I mean, I'm not particularly 
looking for one,

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.990
but if I saw a shivering 
puppy in front of me...

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.610
I'd take care of it for life.

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:24.660
That kind of thing doesn't 
actually happen, you know.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.210
Are you sure you can actually 
take care of a dog?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.170
Of course I can.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:31.470
If I had a dog, I'd feed it steak every day!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.540
I'd buy it anything it wanted!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.800
Oh, man, Chuuya would be terrible 
at taking care of dogs.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:38.220
What?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.540
Nothing's a bigger waste of 
time than talking to you.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:41.300
Later.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:42.780
Wait, Chuuya.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:43.480
What?

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:51.230
<b>Meat</b>

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:51.230
<b>Meat</b>

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:47.450
You can practice taking
 care of a dog with me.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.930
Wanna adopt me?

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.230
You just want steak!

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.160
Nah, I'm kidding.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.700
I shudder at the thought of 
living with a slug like you.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:59.510
Anyway, I don't think you're 
ready to have a dog yet.

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:00.670
Shut up!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:10.000
<b>How to
 Raise Puppies</b>

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.440
<i>How to Raise Puppies,</i> huh?

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:05.870
What?!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.900
Is it wrong for me to read this book?

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.410
I didn't say anything.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.600
What are you doing, Dazai-san?

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.620
This lifestyle's kind of grown on me.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.440
I'm addicted.
